file .claude/rules/vocabulary-aroma.md the two retirements, the G-friendly default, the opt-in rating, and the depth declined with its reason
file .claude/rules/the-baton.md every baton section mapped to its rule, and the four that had none written out
file tools/l/fleet_baton.txt the shared opening, written once and prepended by the loop
file tools/l/fleet-loop.sh seat_prompt() prepends the baton; no invocation reads a stanza bare
file construction/fleet-roster.kyri three berthed ships, and the status word that keeps them honest
file foundations/20260826-021735_earth-the-row-that-breathes-in.md the threshold page, renamed by the breach, its elder basename listed as intent
recommend check-in (Keaton) -- three trees want birthing and a claude login each, which is a hand; the session-log README split and the yonder relevance sweep are named and unstarted
